  "Create model classes with `fromJson` and `toJson` methods using `dart:convert`. Use when manually mapping JSON keys to class properties for simple data structures.": "Создание классов моделей с методами fromJson и toJson с помощью dart:convert для сериализации данных.",
  "Configure `MaterialApp.router` using a package like `go_router` for advanced URL-based navigation. Use when developing web applications or mobile apps that require specific deep linking and browser history support.": "Настройка декларативной маршрутизации MaterialApp.router с go_router для глубоких ссылок (deep linking) и навигации.",
  "Add `flutter_localizations` and `intl` dependencies, enable \"generate true\" in `pubspec.yaml`, and create an `l10n.yaml` configuration file. Use when initializing localization support for a new Flutter project.": "Настройка мультиязычности и локализации во Flutter (flutter_localizations, intl, l10n.yaml).",
  "Use the `http` package to execute GET, POST, PUT, or DELETE requests. Use when you need to fetch from or send data to a REST API.": "Использование пакета http для выполнения HTTP-запросов (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) к REST API.",
  "Use this skill when writing code that calls the Gemini API for text generation, multi-turn chat, multimodal understanding, image generation, video generation, streaming responses, background research tasks, function calling, structured output, or migrating from the old generateContent API. Covers SDK usage and best practices for Gemini models and agents in Python and TypeScript.": "Разработка приложений с использованием Gemini API (генерация текста, мультимодальный анализ, вызов функций, структурированный вывод) на Python и TypeScript.",
  "Use this skill when writing code that calls the Gemini API for text generation, multi-turn chat, multimodal understanding, image generation, video generation, streaming responses, background research tasks, function calling, structured output, or migrating from the old generateContent API. This skill covers the Interactions API, the recommended way to use Gemini models and agents in Python and TypeScript.": "Использование Gemini Interactions API для диалогов, мультимодального анализа, вызова функций и агентов в Python и TypeScript.",
  "Use this skill when building real-time, bidirectional streaming applications with the Gemini Live API. Covers WebSocket-based audio/video/text streaming, voice activity detection (VAD), native audio features, function calling, session management, ephemeral tokens for client-side auth, live translation, and all Live API configuration options. SDKs covered - google-genai (Python), @google/genai (JavaScript/TypeScript).": "Создание приложений реального времени с двунаправленным потоковым аудио/видео через Gemini Live API и WebSockets.",
  "Use this skill for generative video editing, text-to-video, image-referenced video generation, first-frame-to-video, first-and-last-frame transitions, and video extensions using Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash (gemini-omni-1.1-flash) via the official google-genai SDK. Includes workflows for pre-processing/optimizing high-resolution or long source videos with ffmpeg, stripping audio for full sound regeneration, and handling turn-by-turn video editing and parallel execution.": "Генеративное редактирование и создание видео, преобразование текста в видео и анимация переходов через Gemini Omni Flash API.",
  "Publishes software releases to GitHub and automatically broadcasts formatted release announcements and compiled binary or installer assets to the developer's Telegram community (@Upgitpro_bot in chat -1003876400622). Use whenever releasing new software versions, publishing tags or GitHub Releases, or deploying build artifacts across ANY project.": "Публикация релизов на GitHub с автоматической отправкой анонсов и скомпилированных бинарников в Telegram (@Upgitpro_bot).",
  "Design, implement, and debug autonomous AI agents and multi-agent systems using the Google Antigravity (AGY) SDK. ACTIVATE this skill when the user wants to create, configure, or orchestrate Google Antigravity agents.": "Проектирование, реализация и отладка автономных ИИ-агентов и мультиагентных систем с помощью Google Antigravity SDK.",
  "A collection of skills for architecting and implementing production-ready code using Google Maps Platform APIs and SDKs for any map, place, address, geocoding, routing/ETA (including eco-friendly routing), nearby search, 3D / Street View / static map, marker clustering, custom styling, drawing, geofencing, heatmap, or environmental (air-quality / pollen / solar / weather) feature — across Web, Android, iOS, and Web Services APIs. For prototyping, use the public Maps Demo Key — no billing setup and no Cloud project required, covering a growing set of the most popular Google Maps Platform APIs. For production, the skill prompts you to create and restrict your own key. All non-trivial code is grounded in freshly retrieved docs via the Google Maps Platform Code Assist service (no reliance on training-data memory).": "Разработка и интеграция Google Maps Platform APIs и SDK (карты, адреса, маршруты, Street View, поиск мест) для Web, Android и iOS.",
  'Are you sure you want to mark 1 conversation as read? This action cannot be undone.': 'Вы уверены, что хотите отметить 1 диалог как прочитанный? Это действие нельзя отменить.',
