  "Guide line for the chart.": "Направляющая линия для диаграммы.",
  "Guidelines for interacting with GitHub and request permissions from the user when commands fail due to restrictions in the agent environment.": "Взаимодействие с репозиториями GitHub с использованием GitHub CLI или API с соответствующими правами доступа и запросом разрешений у пользователя.",
  "Guides the process of analyzing, mapping, and documenting transformations between source and target schemas for any database, data warehouse, or data platform. Focuses exclusively on creating a high-fidelity mapping plan (Mapping Manifesto). Used when initiating an ETL, ELT, or data integration task with schema mapping specification for multiple tables (i.e. more than 3 tables) before writing code. Do NOT use this skill for basic SQL generation without mapping requirements, or when the user already has a complete mapping specification.": "Анализ, сопоставление и документирование преобразований между исходными и целевыми схемами для баз данных, хранилищ данных или платформ данных перед написанием кода.",
  "Guides the process of analyzing, mapping, and documenting transformations\\\n  between source and target schemas for any database, data warehouse, or data platform.\\\n  Focuses exclusively on creating a high-fidelity mapping plan (Mapping Manifesto).\\\n  Used when initiating an ETL, ELT, or data integration task with schema mapping specification\\\n  for multiple tables (i.e. more than 3 tables) before writing code. Do NOT use this\\\n  skill for basic SQL generation without mapping requirements, or when the user already\\\n  has a complete mapping specification.": "Анализ, сопоставление и документирование преобразований между исходными и целевыми схемами для баз данных, хранилищ данных или платформ данных перед написанием кода.",
  "Guides writing, packaging, executing, and troubleshooting Apache Beam pipelines on Dataflow. Use when creating new pipelines, configuring Flex Templates, or analyzing performance of Dataflow jobs. Capabilities include Java/Python/Go setup, Cloud Build integration, and deep diagnostic analysis of job health and autoscaling. Use when: - Creating an Apache Beam Dataflow pipeline. - Creating a Google Dataflow Flex Template. - Using an existing Google Dataflow Template. - Debugging Dataflow pipeline - Troubleshooting Dataflow pipeline - Analyzing Performance of Dataflow pipeline. Key capabilities: Java/Python/Go project setup, Flex Templates (with Cloud Build), and diagnostics for streaming job health, bottlenecks, and autoscaling. Do NOT use for: - General GCP resource management unrelated to Dataflow. - Issues with other GCP services (e.g., GCE, GCS, BigQuery) unless directly impacting Dataflow pipeline execution. - Pipeline technologies other than Apache Beam on Dataflow.": "Руководство по написанию, сборке, выполнению и устранению неполадок конвейеров Apache Beam на Dataflow (настройка проектов Java/Python/Go, шаблоны Flex и диагностика потоковых заданий).",
  "Guides writing, packaging, executing, and troubleshooting Apache Beam pipelines on Dataflow. Use when creating new pipelines, configuring Flex Templates, or analyzing performance of Dataflow jobs. Capabilities include Java/Python/Go setup, Cloud Build integration, and deep diagnostic analysis of job health and autoscaling.\\\n  Use when: - Creating an Apache Beam Dataflow pipeline. - Creating a Google Dataflow Flex Template. - Using an existing Google Dataflow Template. - Debugging Dataflow pipeline - Troubleshooting Dataflow pipeline - Analyzing Performance of Dataflow pipeline.\\\n  Key capabilities: Java/Python/Go project setup, Flex Templates (with Cloud Build), and diagnostics for streaming job health, bottlenecks, and autoscaling.\\\n  Do NOT use for: - General GCP resource management unrelated to Dataflow. - Issues with other GCP services (e.g., GCE, GCS, BigQuery) unless directly\\\n    impacting Dataflow pipeline execution.\\\n  - Pipeline technologies other than Apache Beam on Dataflow.": "Руководство по написанию, сборке, выполнению и устранению неполадок конвейеров Apache Beam на Dataflow (настройка проектов Java/Python/Go, шаблоны Flex и диагностика потоковых заданий).",
