  "Provide Google Cloud Project": "Укажите проект Google Cloud",
  "Provide feedback": "Оставить отзыв",
  "Provides BigQuery SQL query optimization techniques, execution best practices, and performance tuning rules for high-efficiency querying. Use when optimizing BigQuery SQL queries, reducing query costs, or designing performant SQL transformations.": "Предоставляет методы оптимизации SQL-запросов BigQuery, рекомендации по выполнению и правила настройки производительности для высокоэффективных запросов.",
  "Provides BigQuery SQL query optimization techniques, execution best practices,\\\n  and performance tuning rules for high-efficiency querying. Use when optimizing BigQuery\\\n  SQL queries, reducing query costs, or designing performant SQL transformations.": "Предоставляет методы оптимизации SQL-запросов BigQuery, рекомендации по выполнению и правила настройки производительности для высокоэффективных запросов.",
  "Provides a comprehensive guide, quick reference, and sitemap for Google Antigravity (AGY), including the Antigravity CLI (agy), Antigravity 2.0, Antigravity IDE, Python SDK, slash commands, keybindings, and customizations (skills, rules, MCP, sidecars). Activate this skill when the user asks questions about how to use, configure, or customize Antigravity, AGY, the agy CLI, the Antigravity IDE, or Antigravity 2.0.": "Подробное руководство, краткий справочник и карта Google Antigravity (AGY), включая интерфейс командной строки Antigravity (agy), Antigravity 2.0, Antigravity IDE, Python SDK, слэш-команды, горячие клавиши и кастомизации (навыки, правила, MCP, сайдкары).",
  "Provides guidance for migrating Apache Airflow DAGs in Managed Service for Apache Airflow (MSAA; formerly Cloud Composer). Covers migration to Airflow 2.11.1 (MSAA Gen 2 and 3) and Airflow 3 (MSAA Gen 3), including environment inspection, GCS download/upload and scanning patterns for breaking changes.": "Руководство по миграции DAG Apache Airflow в Managed Service for Apache Airflow (MSAA). Проверка окружения, выгрузка из GCS и сканирование на наличие критических изменений.",
  "Provides guidance for migrating Apache Airflow DAGs in Managed Service\\\n  for Apache Airflow (MSAA; formerly Cloud Composer). Covers migration to Airflow\\\n  2.11.1 (MSAA Gen 2 and 3) and Airflow 3 (MSAA Gen 3), including environment inspection,\\\n  GCS download/upload and scanning patterns for breaking changes.": "Руководство по миграции DAG Apache Airflow в Managed Service for Apache Airflow (MSAA). Проверка окружения, выгрузка из GCS и сканирование на наличие критических изменений.",
  "Provides guidelines and best practices for querying and defining property graphs and semantic graphs in BigQuery using GQL (Graph Query Language). Use when creating property graphs or querying graph topologies in BigQuery.": "Предоставляет рекомендации и лучшие практики для запросов и определения графов свойств и семантических графов в BigQuery с использованием GQL (Graph Query Language).",
  "Provides guidelines and best practices for querying and defining property\\\n  graphs and semantic graphs in BigQuery using GQL (Graph Query Language). Use when\\\n  creating property graphs or querying graph topologies in BigQuery.": "Предоставляет рекомендации и лучшие практики для запросов и определения графов свойств и семантических графов в BigQuery с использованием GQL (Graph Query Language).",
  "Provides recommendations and best practices for creating, configuring, tuning and optimizing Managed Service for Apache Airflow (MSAA, Cloud Composer) environments. Use when the user asks for guidance, recommendations, or best practices on configuring Cloud Composer, scaling Airflow environments, preventing workload restarts, or analyzing system health.": "Рекомендации и лучшие практики по созданию, настройке, оптимизации и масштабированию сред Managed Service for Apache Airflow (MSAA, Cloud Composer).",
  "Provides recommendations and best practices for creating, configuring,\\\n  tuning and optimizing Managed Service for Apache Airflow (MSAA, Cloud Composer)\\\n  environments. Use when the user asks for guidance, recommendations, or best practices\\\n  on configuring Cloud Composer, scaling Airflow environments, preventing workload\\\n  restarts, or analyzing system health.": "Рекомендации и лучшие практики по созданию, настройке, оптимизации и масштабированию сред Managed Service for Apache Airflow (MSAA, Cloud Composer).",
